[5.383798, "o", "\u001b[9A\u001b[J\u001b[1G"]
[7.605205, "o", "The Danish phrase \"rødgrød med fløde\" translates to\r\n"]
[7.605437, "o", " **red berry pudding with cream**.\r\n\r\nHere's a breakdown:\r\n\r\n\r\n* **rødgrød:** red berry pudding (it'\r\ns made from a mix of red berries, often strawberries, raspberries,\r\n and red currants)\r\n* **med:** with\r\n* **fl\r\n"]
[7.605469, "o", "øde:** cream\r\n\r\nIt's famously difficult for non-D\r\nanes to pronounce! It's often used as a bit of a\r\n tongue-twister to test someone's Danish pronunciation skills.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n"]
[7.607506, "o", "\u001b[?2004hdeltik@\u001b[1;34mandie2 \u001b[0;0m[~]$ "]
